      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i really dont want to go to the urgent care right now, it's so expensive and the wait is always forever. i had my shots a while ago like... maybe 5 or 6 years ago? also the wound isn't even that big, just deep. if i just use a lot of antibiotic ointment and keep it covered with a heavy bandage, won't that stop anything from getting in there?",
